&lt;div class=&quot;s28&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s27&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with the&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s27&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s27&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;markets to implement campaign rollout, localizing activations as needed and ensuring good communication throughout regarding strategy, asset delivery, campaign updates etc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
